# Aurora Awakener: "Vivid -- When this creature enters, reveal cards from the top of your library until you reveal X permanent cards, where X is the number of colors among
# permanents you control. Put any number of those permanent cards onto the battlefield, then put the rest [...] on the bottom." Bot1 pays {6}{G} with Black Lotus and four
# Moxen; the green Awakener is the only colored permanent, so X is 1. The top of the library is a Lightning Bolt (revealed, not a permanent card) and a Mox Sapphire, the
# first permanent card: the reveal stops there, and Bot1 puts the Sapphire onto the battlefield. The revealed Bolt went to the bottom, so the Memnite under them is what Bot1
# draws on turn 3 and casts.

